+// A profile's extensions (plan C14, OACExtensions.h). //chrome's extension
+// system runs as in Chrome (ExtensionService, the Web Store installer,
+// UnpackedInstaller, ExtensionActionManager / Runner, content scripts); the
+// bridge replaces the parts that are Chrome's toolbar and Views dialogs:
+// - the toolbar: action state per tab is read from ExtensionAction and given
+//   to the shell as data (icon PNG, badge, title, enabled, popup);
+// - popups: an ExtensionViewHost of type popup whose WebContents' view the
+//   shell puts in its own bubble (OACExtensionPopup);
+// - the install dialog: ExtensionInstallPrompt's embedder dialog hook (an
+//   Open Arc patch) turns every confirmation into an
+//   OACExtensionInstallRequest for the profile's delegate.
